==Strategy==
This stage has the same premise as the previous one: get rid of the peons and then you can focus on Mega Cat EX. However, the peons here are much stronger, consisting of [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] and [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]]. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] is a great unit for this. Also bring general [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|tankers]] like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] to subdue the Angel enemies. It is possible to rush this stage, by using a fast critter such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] and [[Merc (Special Cat)|Merc & Cat CC]] to kill the boss and get to the base before the main support comes in.

